index 0000000..670bd9f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/validate-answer-builder-reference-pattern-3f8b2c1d4e5f6a7b.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``AnswerBuilder`` now validates ``reference_pattern`` before using it. A pattern with no capture
+    groups, more than one capture group, or a capture group that matches an empty document index now
+    raises a clear ``ValueError`` instead of failing later with an unclear ``int()`` conversion error.
+    The validation applies to the effective pattern, including a pattern passed to ``run()``.
